		<div id="m_textViewLayer" class="layer" style="z-index: 2; visibility: visible;">
			<div id="m_content" style="font-size: 100%; overflow-y: auto; direction: ltr; right: 20px;"><div><div id="m_topBuffer" style="height: 200px; display: none;"><img src="https://res.public.onecdn.static.microsoft/officeonline/hashed/79b48a07e8b20228/spiral.gif" class="loading" style="top: calc(50% + 20px);"></div><div id="pc1"><div style="height: 0px;"></div><div class="pageNumV2">1 / 17</div><div id="p1" name="p1"><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">e-Governance &amp; Digital Services</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">DigiLocker &amp; UPI</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Introduction :</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">With the rise of e-Governance and Digital services as part of Digital <span style="direction:ltr;">India, encouraging the use of various Digital services provided by the <span style="direction:ltr;">Government of India, it becomes important to research and analyze <span style="direction:ltr;">whether the services are reaching their targeted users or if they are <span style="direction:ltr;">performing up to the mark and the most important question, Are the <span style="direction:ltr;">targeted users really being benefitted from this. &nbsp;<br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">In this project, we will be discussing two Digital Services provided by <span style="direction:ltr;">the Govt of India, DigiLocker and UPI. &nbsp;<br></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Objective</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">:</span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;<br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">To comprehend the strategic planning required in the context of e-<span style="direction:ltr;">governance and digital services. &nbsp;<br></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Approach:</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;<br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">Analyzing the current landscape of DigiLocker and UPI using publicly <span style="direction:ltr;">available data. It was carried out by exploring primary and secondary data <span style="direction:ltr;">sources and by applying Strength, Weaknesses, Opportunities and Threats <span style="direction:ltr;">(SWOT) analysis format. &nbsp;<br></span></span></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">DIGILOCKER</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Introduction:</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc2"><div class="pageNumV2">2 / 17</div><div id="p2" name="p2"><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">DigiLocker, a flagship initiative by the Ministry of Electronics &amp; IT<b><span style="direction:ltr;"> </span></b><span style="direction:ltr;">(MeitY), is reshaping how India accesses and manages documents. A <span style="direction:ltr;">cornerstone of the Digital India program, DigiLocker empowers you <span style="direction:ltr;">with a secure, paperless solution for accessing and sharing official <span style="direction:ltr;">documents anytime, anywhere. <br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">DigiLocker is a cloud-based secure digital wallet to issue, store, and <span style="direction:ltr;">verify paperless official certificates (driving licenses, mark sheets, <span style="direction:ltr;">Aadhaar). <br></span></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><i><span style="direction:ltr;">How to use DigiLocker: </span></i><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">To use Digilocker, Users have to register and verify themselves using <span style="direction:ltr;">OTP using the mobile number linked with AADHAR and then can fetch <span style="direction:ltr;">document by entering required information for the certificate authorities <span style="direction:ltr;">to fetch the required documents. 1 <br></span></span></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><i><span style="direction:ltr;">Official Site:</span></i><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;(<span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;">) <br></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><i><span style="direction:ltr;">Targeted Users:</span></i><span style="direction:ltr;"> All indian citizens, academic institutions and certificate <span style="direction:ltr;">issuing authorities are the targeted user. <br></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#E8E8E8">Situation Analysis:</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">1. As of 31 July 2026, the platform has<span style="direction:ltr;color:#150202"> </span><span style="direction:ltr;">registered over 72<span style="direction:ltr;color:#150202"> </span><span style="direction:ltr;">crore+ <span style="direction:ltr;">users and issued more than<span style="direction:ltr;color:#150202"> </span><span style="direction:ltr;">934+ Cr<span style="direction:ltr;color:#150202"> </span><span style="direction:ltr;">documents. &nbsp;2 <br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></li></ul><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">1 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.com/" target="_blank">www.digilocker.com</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">2 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.pib.gov.in/FactsheetDetails.aspx?Id=150840&amp;reg=3&amp;lang=2" target="_blank">https://www.pib.gov.in/FactsheetDetails.aspx?Id=150840&amp;reg=3&amp;lang=2</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;">) <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc3"><div class="pageNumV2">3 / 17</div><div id="p3" name="p3"><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">2. Dashboard provided in official DigiLocker website showcasing the <span style="direction:ltr;">current number of users. &nbsp;3 <br></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="position: relative; height: 42.1769px; width: 75px; overflow: hidden;"><img "="" id="pi3_0" width="98.8691437802908" style="position: absolute; top: -21.8821px; left: -17.3263px; clip: rect(21.8821px, 92.3263px, 64.059px, 17.3263px); visibility: visible;" src="blob:https://word-edit.officeapps.live.com/22c40a66-ae2d-49d9-a380-79f3cd937620"></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Fig1. DigiLocker Dashboard</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">3. For remote areas, government has established 4,07,122 CSCs <span style="direction:ltr;">functional at the Gram Panchayat level as of 30 June 2026 which <span style="direction:ltr;">help access Functions of digital services including DigiLocker in <span style="direction:ltr;">remote and low connectivity areas. &nbsp;4 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">4. It operates seamlessly alongside AADHAR, eSign, and API Setu <span style="direction:ltr;">to support instant, paperless verification across sectors like <span style="direction:ltr;">banking, education, and transport. Note that it does not mean that <span style="direction:ltr;">every DigiLocker transaction requires AADHAR or eSign.5 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li></ul><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">3 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://app.powerbi.com/view?r=eyJrIjoiMzFjZWY3ZjItZmNmZC00MWU4LWExMzgtZTNiNjgyOGUzOTU2IiwidCI6IjliZDllNTJjLWU1MGItNDUzYS04MzA0LTczMjY4NWM4Y2NlOSJ9" target="_blank">https://app.powerbi.com/view?r=eyJrIjoiMzFjZWY3ZjItZmNmZC00MWU4LWExMzgtZTNiNjgyOGUzOTU2</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://app.powerbi.com/view?r=eyJrIjoiMzFjZWY3ZjItZmNmZC00MWU4LWExMzgtZTNiNjgyOGUzOTU2IiwidCI6IjliZDllNTJjLWU1MGItNDUzYS04MzA0LTczMjY4NWM4Y2NlOSJ9" target="_blank">IiwidCI6IjliZDllNTJjLWU1MGItNDUzYS04MzA0LTczMjY4NWM4Y2NlOSJ9</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">4 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.ibef.org/news/government-expands-citizen-centric-digital-public-service-delivery-through-umang-and-digilocker" target="_blank">https://www.ibef.org/news/government-expands-citizen-centric-digital-public-service-delivery-through-</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.ibef.org/news/government-expands-citizen-centric-digital-public-service-delivery-through-umang-and-digilocker" target="_blank">umang-and-digilocker</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;<br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">5 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.ibef.org/news/government-expands-citizen-centric-digital-public-service-delivery-through-umang-and-digilocker" target="_blank">https://www.ibef.org/news/government-expands-citizen-centric-digital-public-service-delivery-through-</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.ibef.org/news/government-expands-citizen-centric-digital-public-service-delivery-through-umang-and-digilocker" target="_blank">umang-and-digilocker</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;<br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc4"><div class="pageNumV2">4 / 17</div><div id="p4" name="p4"><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#E8E8E8">SWOT Analysis:</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Strength-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The strengths of DigiLocker are- <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· &nbsp;<b><span style="direction:ltr;">Legally Valid -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Digital documents issued through <span style="direction:ltr;">DigiLocker carry the exact same legal validity as original <span style="direction:ltr;">physical documents. 6 &nbsp;<br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Reliable -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> DigiLocker leverages cutting-edge technologies to <span style="direction:ltr;">ensure secure, efficient, and reliable data exchange.7 <br></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Scalable and Seamless Integration-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> DigiLocker's <span style="direction:ltr;">implementation is crafted to be scalable and seamless. <span style="direction:ltr;">Starting with essentials like Aadhaar and driving licenses, <span style="direction:ltr;">DigiLocker has grown to bring in more government bodies, <span style="direction:ltr;">educational institutions, and private organizations through <span style="direction:ltr;">secure, API-based integration.8 <br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Security-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Provides security based on 4 factors Requesters, <span style="direction:ltr;">Issuers, the API Setu Partner Gateway, and the DigiLocker <span style="direction:ltr;">Ecosystem. &nbsp;9 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Weaknesses-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The weaknesses of DigiLocker are- <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Internet &amp; Basic Digital Literacy requirement -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Requires an <span style="direction:ltr;">internet connection, a computer or smartphone and a basic level <span style="direction:ltr;">of digital literacy to login/ register and access documents.10 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li></ul><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">6 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/ecosystem" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/ecosystem</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">7 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/technology" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/technology</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">8 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/implementation-model" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/implementation-model</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">9 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/security-architecture" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/security-architecture</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">10 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/about/faq" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/about/faq</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc5"><div class="pageNumV2">5 / 17</div><div id="p5" name="p5"><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Not 100% Multilingual -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Multilingual feature is not available <span style="direction:ltr;">for every language in India, it is there for major ones but not for <span style="direction:ltr;">all (Example â€“ Urdu is not included)11 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Reliance on API Setu -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> For parts of DigiLockerâ€™s integration <span style="direction:ltr;">and document-exchange architecture may create a dependency <span style="direction:ltr;">risk if the gateway or relevant APIs become unavailable.12 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Outdated documents may persist -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Due to slow immediate <span style="direction:ltr;">updates in the system, outdated documents may persist. &nbsp; <br></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Opportunities-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The opportunities for Digilocker are- <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Online Documents getting legal validation </span></b><span style="direction:ltr;">- As digital <span style="direction:ltr;">documents are gaining validation everywhere, it <span style="direction:ltr;">encourages more users to use DigiLocker to keep legally <span style="direction:ltr;">valid documents.13 <br></span></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Integration with Foreign Universities -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Institutions can <span style="direction:ltr;">leverage systems like eSanad (by the Ministry of External <span style="direction:ltr;">Affairs) to let foreign universities verify Indian academic <span style="direction:ltr;">records seamlessly. 14 <br></span></span></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Threats-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The following are obstacles DigiLocker must overcome - <br></span></div><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">11 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp; <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">12 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/data-exchange" target="_blank">https://www.digilocker.gov.in/web/data-exchange</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">13 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://x.com/_DigitalIndia/status/1866131335670083838?lang=en" target="_blank">https://x.com/_DigitalIndia/status/1866131335670083838?lang=en</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">14 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://esanad.nic.in/" target="_blank">https://esanad.nic.in/</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc6"><div class="pageNumV2">6 / 17</div><div id="p6" name="p6"><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Other applications -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Government applications like NextGen <span style="direction:ltr;">mParivahan and mAadhar allow storing documents legally, and <span style="direction:ltr;">may create competition for user attention. &nbsp;15 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Cyber threats -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> As a centralized government repository, it is <span style="direction:ltr;">prone to be target of data breaches and cyber-attacks.16 <br></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Key Points: </span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The key points drawn from our analysis are - <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· DigiLocker is an excellent tool for storing legally valid physical <span style="direction:ltr;">documents in an online format. &nbsp;<br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· It provides a secure interface for accessing documents <span style="direction:ltr;">integrating cutting edge technologies (encryption, two factor <span style="direction:ltr;">authentication etc) <br></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· With growing validation of online documents, DigiLocker can <span style="direction:ltr;">emerge as a useful tool in many domains and for the public. <br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· But like most online documents, it requires a device and basic <span style="direction:ltr;">digital literacy. <br></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Challenges:</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Low rural digital literacy in India (approximately 37%) as <span style="direction:ltr;">comapred to urban digital literacy rate (approximately 67%) <span style="direction:ltr;">may lead to rural-urban digital divide. &nbsp;<br></span></span></span></div></li></ul><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">15 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://myaadhaarbeta.uidai.gov.in/" target="_blank">https://myaadhaarbeta.uidai.gov.in/</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> , <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://parivahan.gov.in/parivahan/en/content/nextgen-mparivahan" target="_blank">https://parivahan.gov.in/parivahan/en/content/nextgen-</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://parivahan.gov.in/parivahan/en/content/nextgen-mparivahan" target="_blank">mparivahan</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">16 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#215E99">https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/ministry-of-electronics-and-it-</span><span style="direction:ltr;color:#215E99">issues-warning-on-fake-digilocker-apps-how-students-can-secure-their-</span><span style="direction:ltr;color:#215E99">data/articleshow/125911577.cms</span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;<br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc7"><div class="pageNumV2">7 / 17</div><div id="p7" name="p7"><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· More applications providing storage for legal documents may <span style="direction:ltr;">split user attention leading to decline in usage. <br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· There is a big gap between the number of registered users and <span style="direction:ltr;">the number of active users which need to be analyzed further to <span style="direction:ltr;">conclude for any factors affecting it. <br></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Recommendations:</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Awareness campaigns regarding increasing digital literacy rate <span style="direction:ltr;">should be increased specially in rural areas. <br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Conduct useability assessments to identify friction in <span style="direction:ltr;">registration, document discovery, retrieval and sharing. &nbsp;<br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Prioritize interface improvements based on task completion <span style="direction:ltr;">rates and user feedback, with comparisons to similar devices <span style="direction:ltr;">where appropriate. <br></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Analyze the gap between registered users and users who <span style="direction:ltr;">actively use DigiLocker, using a clearly defined activity period. <br></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">UPI (UNIFIED PAYMENTS INTERFACE)</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Introduction:</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">Unified Payments Interface (UPI) is a system that empowers users to <span style="direction:ltr;">add multiple bank and other allowed accounts (of any participating <span style="direction:ltr;">bank) into a UPI App, merging several banking features, seamless fund <span style="direction:ltr;">routing &amp; merchant payments under one hood. UPI is operated by NPCI <span style="direction:ltr;">(National Payments Corporation of India). <br></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc8"><div class="pageNumV2">8 / 17</div><div id="p8" name="p8"><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><i><span style="direction:ltr;">How to use UPI:</span></i><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The steps to &nbsp;register,transaction/ send money or recieve money is <span style="direction:ltr;">explained in the Learn About UPI section of the of the following page <span style="direction:ltr;">from the official UPI website maintained by NPCI &nbsp;<br></span></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">( Link: &nbsp;<span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> ) <br></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><i><span style="direction:ltr;">Official Site: </span></i><span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;<br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><i><span style="direction:ltr;">Targeted Users : </span></i><span style="direction:ltr;">It is intended for all Indian citizens, merchants and <span style="direction:ltr;">banks. <br></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><i><span style="direction:ltr;">Features: <br></span></i></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Immediate money transfer through mobile device 24*7 and 365 <span style="direction:ltr;">days. <br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Single mobile application for accessing different bank accounts. <br></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· 2 Factor Authentication â€“ Aligned with the Regulatory guidelines <span style="direction:ltr;">and provides for a secure and seamless payment. <br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Virtual address of the customer for Pull &amp; Push provides for <span style="direction:ltr;">incremental security with the customer not required to enter the <span style="direction:ltr;">details such as Card no, Account number; IFSC etc. <br></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· QR Code and intent based payments <br></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Best answer to Cash on Delivery hassle, running to an ATM or <span style="direction:ltr;">rendering exact amount. <br></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· P2P and merchant payments <br></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· Grievance redressal from Mobile App directly. <br></span></div></li></ul></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc9"><div class="pageNumV2">9 / 17</div><div id="p9" name="p9"><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Situation Analysis: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">1. Nearly 55.49 Crore users are onboard on UPI as of June 2026 <span style="direction:ltr;">along with 12 countries using UPI for seamless cross border <span style="direction:ltr;">transaction on UPI.17 <br></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">2. As of September 2026, 756 banks are live on UPI. &nbsp;18 <br></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">3. As of Financial year 2025-26, 24161.69 Crore is the volume of <span style="direction:ltr;">Transactions and 314.23 lakh crore is the value.19 <br></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="overflow-y: auto; direction: ltr;"><div style="display: inline-block;"><table border="1" style="direction:ltr"><tbody><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">Financial Year <br></span></div></th><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">Volume (in Crore)<b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></span></div></th><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">Value (in lakh <span style="direction:ltr;">Crore)<b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></span></span></div></th></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">FY 2021-22 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">4,595.61 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">84.16 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">FY 2022-23 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">8,371.44 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">139.15 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">FY 2023-24 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">13,112.95 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">199.95 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">FY 2024-25 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">18,586.60 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">260.56 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">FY 2025-26 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">24,161.69 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">314.23 <br></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Table1. UPI Data for the last 5 Financial years</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="overflow-y: auto; direction: ltr;"><div style="display: inline-block;"><table border="1" style="direction:ltr"><tbody><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Month</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div></th><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">No. of Banks live on UPI <br></span></b></div></th><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Volume (In Mn.) <br></span></b></div></th><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Value (In Cr.) <br></span></b></div></th></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">March-2026 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">705 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">22,641.11 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">29,52,542.05 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">February-2026 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">694 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">20,394.18 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">26,84,229.29 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">January-2026 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">691 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">21,703.44 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">28,33,481.22 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">December-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">685 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">21,634.67 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">27,96,712.73 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">November-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">684 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">20,466.98 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">26,31,632.63 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">October-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">683 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">20,700.92 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">27,27,790.68 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">September-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">686 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">19,633.43 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">24,89,736.54 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">August-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">688 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">20,008.31 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">24,85,472.91 <br></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">17 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2286608&amp;reg=48&amp;lang=1" target="_blank">https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2286608&amp;reg=48&amp;lang=1</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp;<br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">18 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/product-statistics" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/product-statistics</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">19 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2286608&amp;reg=48&amp;lang=1" target="_blank">https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2286608&amp;reg=48&amp;lang=1</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp; <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc10"><div class="pageNumV2">10 / 17</div><div id="p10" name="p10"><div style="overflow-y: auto; direction: ltr;"><div style="display: inline-block;"><table border="1" style="direction:ltr"><tbody><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">July-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">684 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">19,467.95 <br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">25,08,498.09 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">June-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">675 &nbsp;<br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">18,395.01 &nbsp;<br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">24,03,930.69 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">May-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">673 &nbsp;<br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">18,677.46 &nbsp;<br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">25,14,297.01 <br></span></div></td></tr><tr><th><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">April-2025 <br></span></div></th><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">668 &nbsp;<br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">17,893.42 &nbsp;<br></span></div></td><td><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">23,94,925.87 <br></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Table2. UPI Data for FY 2025-26</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">4. The statistics including number of banks, volume and value of <span style="direction:ltr;">UPI Transactions as displayed in the official UPI website by NPCI <span style="direction:ltr;">are attached. 20 &nbsp;<br></span></span></span></div><div style="position: relative; height: 41.3396px; width: 75px; overflow: hidden;"><img "="" id="pi10_0" width="104.43686006825938" style="position: absolute; top: -44.7184px; left: -18.302px; clip: rect(44.7184px, 93.302px, 86.058px, 18.302px); visibility: visible;" src="blob:https://word-edit.officeapps.live.com/3d1d5216-e4a5-4ba2-b600-fc1d46602d00"></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Fig2. UPI Volume Transaction for the FY 2026-27</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">20 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/product-statistics" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/product-statistics</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc11"><div class="pageNumV2">11 / 17</div><div id="p11" name="p11"><div style="position: relative; height: 41.0902px; width: 75px; overflow: hidden;"><img "="" id="pi11_0" width="103.51826792963463" style="position: absolute; top: -12.0518px; left: -18.1411px; clip: rect(12.0518px, 93.1411px, 53.1419px, 18.1411px); visibility: visible;" src="blob:https://word-edit.officeapps.live.com/bca8b5c2-09e5-4478-972a-e5b5426d1db0"></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Fig3. UPI Value for FY 2026-27</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">5. Users can dial *99# from their bank-registered mobile number <span style="direction:ltr;">to access a menu-driven banking and UPI interface without <span style="direction:ltr;">needing an internet connection.The service operates across <span style="direction:ltr;">multiple regional Indian language. Offline UPI transactions via <span style="direction:ltr;">*99# have a standard cap of up to â‚¹5,000 per transaction.Note that <span style="direction:ltr;">all the features of UPI will not be available in this, but most <span style="direction:ltr;">transactions wont be affected. &nbsp;21 <br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">21 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.pib.gov.in/FactsheetDetails.aspx?Id=150962&amp;reg=3&amp;lang=1" target="_blank">https://www.pib.gov.in/FactsheetDetails.aspx?Id=150962&amp;reg=3&amp;lang=1</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc12"><div class="pageNumV2">12 / 17</div><div id="p12" name="p12"><div style="position: relative; height: 41.6799px; width: 75px; overflow: hidden;"><img "="" id="pi12_0" width="97.45222929936305" style="position: absolute; top: -11.2261px; left: -16.9586px; clip: rect(11.2261px, 91.9586px, 52.9061px, 16.9586px); visibility: visible;" src="blob:https://word-edit.officeapps.live.com/9f33c517-5ca9-4a91-aa55-60a0e36a3206"></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Fig4. Share of UPI in Total Payments</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></b></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">SWOT Analysis: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Strength-</span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The Strengths of UPI are - <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Integrates multiple bank accounts -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> UPI seamlessly integrates <span style="direction:ltr;">multiple bank accounts of the same user into one single mobile <span style="direction:ltr;">applications using &nbsp;NPCI designed protocols.22 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Can transact every time of the day-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;">It provides 24/7/365 <span style="direction:ltr;">Immediate payment service that ensures money is settled <span style="direction:ltr;">instantly rather than depending on working hours.23 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li></ul><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">22 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.digitalindia.gov.in/initiative/unified-payment-interface-upi/" target="_blank">https://www.digitalindia.gov.in/initiative/unified-payment-interface-upi/</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">23<span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc13"><div class="pageNumV2">13 / 17</div><div id="p13" name="p13"><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Cross platform operability- </span></b><span style="direction:ltr;">UPI has cross platform operability <span style="direction:ltr;">as it allows user on one app to interact with merchant/ other user <span style="direction:ltr;">on another app.24 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Security -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Conceals the user's IFSC codes and account numbers <span style="direction:ltr;">with recipients by executing transactions using virtual private <span style="direction:ltr;">address and QR code.25 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Authentication -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Requires a user-configured UPI pin to debit <span style="direction:ltr;">requests securely.26 <br></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;color:#FF0000">Weaknesses-</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The weaknesses of UPI are - <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Limited Transaction -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Daily Standard P2P(Peer-to-Peer) transfers <span style="direction:ltr;">are capped at 1Lakh rupees only with 2-5 Lakh reserved strictly for <span style="direction:ltr;">capital markets, insurance, education etc.27 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Internet Requirement - </span></b><span style="direction:ltr;">Requires an active internet connection for <span style="direction:ltr;">transaction more than 5000 Rupees. Till 5000 Rupees, USSD <span style="direction:ltr;">codes can be used.28 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Risk of Financial loss -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Debit request disguised as credit sent by <span style="direction:ltr;">scammers may exploit users into entering their pin to receive <span style="direction:ltr;">money.29 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Delayed Transactions -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Payment settlement may be delayed due <span style="direction:ltr;">to technical glitzes, leaving a transaction to be interrupted.30 <br></span></span></span></div></li></ul><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">24 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/myupi.html" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/myupi.html</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">25 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp; <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">26 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp; <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">27 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/product/upi/about-upi</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">28 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.bhimupi.org.in/upi-circle.html" target="_blank">https://www.bhimupi.org.in/upi-circle.html</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> &nbsp; <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">29 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.npci.org.in/fraud-awareness" target="_blank">https://www.npci.org.in/fraud-awareness</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">30 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.srinivaspublication.com/" target="_blank">www.srinivaspublication.com</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> , Mahesh et al 2021) <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="pc14"><div class="pageNumV2">14 / 17</div><div id="p14" name="p14"><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Only for bank account holders -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> UPI can only used by users who <span style="direction:ltr;">have a bank account, leaving the unbanked rural population.31 <br></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><b><span style="direction:ltr;">Opportunities: &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;">The opportunities for UPI are- <br></span></div><ul style="margin-left:33px;"><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">More security -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Integration with &nbsp;biometric authentication is <span style="direction:ltr;">further expected to add one more layer of security to UPI, making <span style="direction:ltr;">transactions more convenient and secure.32 <br></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Enhanced Merchant Solution -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Future innovations are likely to <span style="direction:ltr;">focus on expanding its merchant solutions. We can expect more <span style="direction:ltr;">seamless integration of UPI into online and offline retail platforms, <span style="direction:ltr;">enabling consumers to make instant payments at stores, <span style="direction:ltr;">restaurants, and e-commerce websites.33 <br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Integration with Blockchain technology -</span></b><span style="direction:ltr;"> Blockchain technology <span style="direction:ltr;">holds immense potential for enhancing the security, transparency, <span style="direction:ltr;">and efficiency of digital transactions. In the future, UPI could <span style="direction:ltr;">leverage blockchain technology to strengthen its infrastructure and <span style="direction:ltr;">provide users with an even more secure payment ecosystem34 <br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></li><li><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">Â· <b><span style="direction:ltr;">Oversees Expansion </span></b><span style="direction:ltr;">- &nbsp;UPI has primarily focused on domestic <span style="direction:ltr;">transactions within India. However, as UPI gains recognition and <span style="direction:ltr;">adoption globally, future innovations may enable cross-border <span style="direction:ltr;">remittances. This would allow users to send and receive money <span style="direction:ltr;">internationally using UPI.35 <br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></li></ul><div style="direction:ltr;margin-top:5px"><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></div><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">31 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.srinivaspublication.com/" target="_blank">www.srinivaspublication.com</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> , Mahesh et al 2021 <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">32 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years" target="_blank">https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">33 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years" target="_blank">https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">34 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years" target="_blank">https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br><hr class="FootnoteEndnoteHr"><div class="FootnoteEndnote"><div style="direction:ltr;"><span style="direction:ltr;">35 <span style="direction:ltr;color:#467886"><a href="https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years" target="_blank">https://www.au.bank.in/blogs/future-innovations-in-upi-what-to-expect-in-coming-years</a></span><span style="direction:ltr;"> <br></span></span></div></div><br></div><hr class="pageHrV2"></div><div id="m_endBuffer" style="height: 200px;"><img src="https://res.public.onecdn.static.microsoft/officeonline/hashed/79b48a07e8b20228/spiral.gif" class="loading"></div></div></div>
		</div>
